      "seq": 6,
      "author": {
        "type": "host"
      },
      "kind": "narration",
      "content": "Proposition argued that taxing sugary drinks changes behaviour and funds health measures; Opposition argued it is compulsion, regressive, and a blunt instrument. We now move to closing statements.",
      "status": "complete",
